# Claude Code: personal-local settings, never shared/committed
.claude/settings.local.json
# Locally-installed skills (e.g. `npx impeccable install`) — regenerable
# third-party content, same reasoning as node_modules. .claude/launch.json
# and any other project-level .claude/ config stay tracked.
.claude/skills/
